 "about": "A Gold-Class husband brings home a government form that would fold his marriage into the state; his wife reads it, says no, and answers with a form of her own, because in this Republic consent still outvotes a committee.",
 "beats": [
  {
   "k": "title",
   "mood": "playful and comic"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A model home in a gated community where everyone has been told to read Plato. A marble Socrates sits on the counter where the fruit bowl should be.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p0a"
    },
    "a marble bust on a kitchen counter"
   ],
   "mood": "playful and comic",
   "wav": "pilot/ep07/v01.wav",
